  exit=0

Coverage demonstrated by these tests:

  - Repeated identical user text is appended once per call; the second canonical
    loop input is old history plus exactly one current user input.
  - The Agent invokes RunCanonical, appends its returned per-call delta once,
    and preserves nested JSON ToolCall Args plus ContentBlocks ImageURL and
    Usage across mutation of both the loop-returned values and Messages() copies.
  - Legacy loops that expose unreceipted tool calls or injected steering/follow-up
    fail closed with ErrCanonicalTranscriptRequired; simple legacy history stays
    source-compatible.
  - Sub-agent Send reports a full inbox or terminal state and Received includes
    only messages accepted into the channel.

