  Registered all 13 names in the expression.

  rtk env GOMAXPROCS=2 go test -race -p 2 -count=1 ./internal/core -run '^(TestAgentConsumesCanonicalDeltaAcrossRepeatedUserTurns|TestAgentRejectsInvalidCanonicalDelta|TestAgentAcceptsCanonicalDeltaForEmptyUserInput|TestAgentCanonicalHistoryDeepCopiesToolCallArgs|TestHistoryRejectsLegacyPureToolCallTurn|TestAgentLegacyLoopRejectsTextAndToolCalls|TestAgentLegacyPureToolCallIsNotSaved|TestAgentLegacyToolCallTurnsAreRejected|TestAgentWithHistoryPreservesOrder|TestAgentWithMultipleHistoryOptions|TestSubagentSendReportsDroppedMessage|TestSubAgentSendDoesNotBlockOnFullInbox|TestSubAgentSendAfterTerminalIsRejected)$'
  exit=0

Canonical delta validation rejects an empty delta, a missing or malformed
initial user entry, a content mismatch, and duplicate initial user entries. On
rejection it returns ErrCanonicalTranscriptInvalid, reports unsuccessful with
an empty unverified result message, and keeps the previously valid history
unchanged. A valid initial user with empty content remains accepted.

