  and TestSubagentSendReportsDroppedMessage.

  rtk env GOMAXPROCS=2 go test -race -p 2 -count=1 ./internal/core -run '^(TestSubAgentPanicIsContainedAndFinalized|TestSubagentSendReportsDroppedMessage|TestSubAgentSendDoesNotBlockOnFullInbox|TestSubAgentSendAfterTerminalIsRejected)$'
  exit=0

The panic fixture covers both runner-factory and runner.Run panics. Each is
converted to ErrSubAgentPanicked, marks the sub-agent Failed, stores an empty
result and error, records an error event when the buffer has room, ends the run
span, closes the event channel and done signal, and rejects a later Send. The
test continues running after each panic, demonstrating that the host test
process survives. Full core-package race remains pending lane 01's
RunCanonical producer and integration.
